02:000338F0 4E75            	  2409:     rts
                            	  2410: 
                            	  2411: ; Params:
                            	  2412: ; A: cursor Y
                            	  2413: ;
                            	  2414: ; Returns:
                            	  2415: ; Y: adjusted cursor Y, or $F8 to hide it
                            	  2416: ;
                            	  2417: ; Description:
                            	  2418: ; Adjust the Y coordinate to account for the visible part of
                            	  2419: ; block cursor being in the bottom half of sprite.
                            	  2420: ; Also, make the cursor flash.
