                            	  3696: _L_z07_WieldFlute_Found:
                            	  3697:     ; Found.
                            	  3698:     ;
                            	  3699:     ; If it was the first room in the list, handle it specially.
                            	  3700:     ; This room is the only one in Q1 with a flute secret. It's also
                            	  3701:     ; the only one in the list without a flute secret in Q2.
                            	  3702:     ;
                            	  3703:     ; In Q2, go summon the whirlwind. In Q1, continue to reveal
                            	  3704:     ; the secret.
                            	  3705:     ;
