                            	  5234:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5235:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5236:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5237:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5238:     ;
                            	  5239:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5240:     ;
                            	  5241:     ; In major state $30, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $40.
                            	  5242:     ;
